                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "id": "0,38,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "elements": "As you can see, the parameters - the degree of the root and the expression under the radical - remain, only the root itself has been deleted. You can delete the division symbol in a similar way. From the ",
